# Without this file BuildKit transfers node_modules, .git and every build artifact
# into the daemon before running a single instruction. On a bind-mounted Windows
# volume that took over four minutes just to read the Dockerfile.

node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
.github

**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright

.vscode
.idea
